  "bodyText": "Project Lifecycle Platform\n\nCreate RFI\n\nInspection Checklist\n\n(* Required fields)\n\nPage 2 of 2\n\nCreated at\n\nN/A\n\nLast updated on\n\nN/A\n\nAnswer all the questions\n\n1. Bench Mark / GPS Co-ordinates / Reference Point Co-ordinates *\n\nObservation/Measured Value\nCapture Photo\n\nUse Camera\n\n2. Marking of Pile ( Northing & Easting ) *\n\nObservation/Measured Value\nCapture Photo\n\nUse Camera\n\n3. Diameter of Pile ( MM ) *\n\nObservation/Measured Value\nCapture Photo\n\nUse Camera\n\n4. Depth of Bore ( form NGL) - (MM) *\n\nObservation/Measured Value\nCapture Photo\n\nUse Camera\n\n5. Template Fixing / Position *\n\nObservation/Measured Value\nCapture Photo\n\nUse Camera\n\n6. Pile Distance ( P1 to P2 ) - ( MM ) *\n\nObservation/Measured Value\nCapture Photo\n\nUse Camera\n\n7. Pile Distance ( Row to Row ) - ( MM ) *\n\nObservation/Measured Value\nCapture Photo\n\nUse Camera\n\n8. Top level Height Variation ( Within Table ) *\n\nObservation/Measured Value\nCapture Photo\n\nUse Camera\n\n9. Column Post Tilt / Plumb *\n\nObservation/Measured Value\nCapture Photo\n\nUse Camera\n\n10. Clear Cover ( MM ) preferable pile stub should centre of bore *\n\nObservation/Measured Value\nCapture Photo\n\nUse Camera\n\n11. Grade of Concrete *\n\nObservation/Measured Value\nCapture Photo\n\nUse Camera\n\n12. Concrete Quantity ( Cum) *\n\nObservation/Measured Value\nCapture Photo\n\nUse Camera\n\n13. Slump requirement at pouring stage *\n\nObservation/Measured Value\nCapture Photo\n\nUse Camera\n\n14. Mode of Concrete Placing *\n\nObservation/Measured Value\nCapture Photo\n\nUse Camera\n\n15. Concrete Compaction *\n\nObservation/Measured Value\nCapture Photo\n\nUse Camera\n\n16. Cube Sampling / No of Cube required for casting *\n\nObservation/Measured Value\nCapture Photo\n\nUse Camera\n\nCancel\nDraft\nSubmit\n0.03"
